model_calls.content:
{"answer":"After you hand over the Fingerslayer Blade, Ranni gives you the Carian Inverted Statue and Renna's Rise opens. Go to Renna's Rise, climb to the top, and use the sending gate to reach the upper part of Ainsel River [3]. Note that giving her the blade immediately ends Preceptor Seluvis's quest [3].

Pick up the Miniature Ranni near where you arrive, rest at the Ainsel River Main Site of Grace, and use the "Talk to miniature Ranni" option three times so she speaks [3]. Her extra dialogue at the Nokstella sites is optional. Continue past the Nokstella Waterfall Basin to defeat the Baleful Shadow and get the Discarded Palace Key, then open the chest in Rennala's boss room for the Dark Moon Ring [3].

Next, defeat Astel at the end of the Lake of Rot and take the lift upward; it only works once you have the Dark Moon Ring. Go to the Cathedral of Manus Celes, descend through the tunnel near the altar, and interact with Ranni sitting on the corpse of her Two Fingers to trigger the cutscene [3].","evidence":[{"index":3,"quote_ids":["q0"]}],"insufficient":false}

